==============================================================================
THREAT HUNTING QUERIES
==============================================================================
Unlike detection alerts (which fire on known bad), these queries help you
proactively HUNT for suspicious activity that may not have triggered alerts.
==============================================================================


==============================================================================
HUNT 1: Rare Process Execution
==============================================================================
Find processes that have executed only a few times in your environment.
Rare = often malicious.

index=endpoint sourcetype="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational"
| rex field=_raw "<EventID>(?<EventID>\d+)</EventID>"
| search EventID=1
| rex field=_raw "<Data Name='Image'>(?<Image>[^<]+)</Data>"
| stats count by Image
| where count < 5
| sort count


==============================================================================
HUNT 2: Unusual Parent-Child Process Pairs
==============================================================================
Surfaces uncommon parent → child relationships that may indicate compromise.

index=endpoint sourcetype="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational"
| rex field=_raw "<EventID>(?<EventID>\d+)</EventID>"
| search EventID=1
| rex field=_raw "<Data Name='Image'>(?<Image>[^<]+)</Data>"
| rex field=_raw "<Data Name='ParentImage'>(?<ParentImage>[^<]+)</Data>"
| stats count by ParentImage, Image
| where count < 3
| sort count


==============================================================================
HUNT 3: Processes Making External Network Connections
==============================================================================
Lists every process that made an outbound connection.
Look for unexpected ones (e.g., notepad.exe shouldn't be reaching the internet).

index=endpoint sourcetype="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational"
| rex field=_raw "<EventID>(?<EventID>\d+)</EventID>"
| search EventID=3
| rex field=_raw "<Data Name='Image'>(?<Image>[^<]+)</Data>"
| rex field=_raw "<Data Name='DestinationIp'>(?<DestinationIp>[^<]+)</Data>"
| stats dc(DestinationIp) as uniq_dest count by Image
| sort -uniq_dest


==============================================================================
HUNT 4: Long Command Lines (Obfuscation Indicator)
==============================================================================
Very long command lines often hide encoded payloads, base64, or obfuscation.

index=endpoint sourcetype="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational"
| rex field=_raw "<EventID>(?<EventID>\d+)</EventID>"
| search EventID=1
| rex field=_raw "<Data Name='Image'>(?<Image>[^<]+)</Data>"
| rex field=_raw "<Data Name='CommandLine'>(?<CommandLine>[^<]+)</Data>"
| eval cmd_length = len(CommandLine)
| where cmd_length > 500
| table _time, Image, cmd_length, CommandLine
| sort -cmd_length


==============================================================================
HUNT 5: Processes Running From Unusual Locations
==============================================================================
Executables in temp, downloads, AppData are highly suspicious.

index=endpoint sourcetype="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational"
| rex field=_raw "<EventID>(?<EventID>\d+)</EventID>"
| search EventID=1
| rex field=_raw "<Data Name='Image'>(?<Image>[^<]+)</Data>"
| search Image="*\\Temp\\*" OR Image="*\\Downloads\\*" 
      OR Image="*\\AppData\\*" OR Image="*\\Public\\*"
| stats count by Image, User
| sort -count


==============================================================================
HUNT 6: After-Hours Process Activity
==============================================================================
Activity outside business hours can indicate compromise or insider threat.

index=endpoint sourcetype="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational"
| rex field=_raw "<EventID>(?<EventID>\d+)</EventID>"
| search EventID=1
| eval hour = strftime(_time, "%H")
| where hour < 6 OR hour > 22
| rex field=_raw "<Data Name='Image'>(?<Image>[^<]+)</Data>"
| rex field=_raw "<Data Name='User'>(?<User>[^<]+)</Data>"
| stats count by User, Image, hour
| sort -count


==============================================================================
HUNT 7: Persistence Via Registry Run Keys
==============================================================================
Registry modifications to autorun locations.

index=endpoint sourcetype="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational"
| rex field=_raw "<EventID>(?<EventID>\d+)</EventID>"
| search EventID=13
| rex field=_raw "<Data Name='TargetObject'>(?<TargetObject>[^<]+)</Data>"
| rex field=_raw "<Data Name='Image'>(?<Image>[^<]+)</Data>"
| rex field=_raw "<Data Name='Details'>(?<Details>[^<]+)</Data>"
| search TargetObject="*\\Run\\*" OR TargetObject="*\\RunOnce\\*"
      OR TargetObject="*\\CurrentVersion\\Image File Execution Options\\*"
| table _time, Image, TargetObject, Details


==============================================================================
HUNT 8: DNS to Suspicious TLDs
==============================================================================
DNS queries to free/abused TLDs (.tk, .top, .xyz, .ru, .cn).

index=endpoint sourcetype="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational"
| rex field=_raw "<EventID>(?<EventID>\d+)</EventID>"
| search EventID=22
| rex field=_raw "<Data Name='QueryName'>(?<QueryName>[^<]+)</Data>"
| rex field=_raw "<Data Name='Image'>(?<Image>[^<]+)</Data>"
| search QueryName="*.tk" OR QueryName="*.top" OR QueryName="*.xyz" 
      OR QueryName="*.ru" OR QueryName="*.cn" OR QueryName="*.ml"
| stats count by QueryName, Image


==============================================================================
HUNT 9: New Service Installation
==============================================================================
A common persistence technique.

index=endpoint source="WinEventLog:System"
| rex field=_raw "<EventID>(?<EventID>\d+)</EventID>"
| search EventID=7045
| rex field=_raw "<Data Name='ServiceName'>(?<ServiceName>[^<]+)</Data>"
| rex field=_raw "<Data Name='ImagePath'>(?<ImagePath>[^<]+)</Data>"
| table _time, ServiceName, ImagePath
| sort -_time


==============================================================================
HUNT 10: Account Enumeration
==============================================================================
Repeated `net user`, `net group`, AD enumeration commands.

index=endpoint sourcetype="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational"
| rex field=_raw "<EventID>(?<EventID>\d+)</EventID>"
| search EventID=1
| rex field=_raw "<Data Name='CommandLine'>(?<CommandLine>[^<]+)</Data>"
| rex field=_raw "<Data Name='User'>(?<User>[^<]+)</Data>"
| search CommandLine="net user*" OR CommandLine="net group*" 
      OR CommandLine="net localgroup*" OR CommandLine="*Get-ADUser*"
      OR CommandLine="*Get-ADGroup*"
| stats count by User, CommandLine
| where count > 3
| sort -count
